      span.c12.c10 Our Policy
      span.c5 :
    p.c0
      span.c5
    p.c2
      span
        | The purpose of these Privacy Terms is to describe how Dental Clinician
        | provides Dr. Molar AI, a Dental Diagnosis Automation Platform that
        | allows users to self-assess dental conditions. By answering routine
        | dental examination questions (chief complaints, history of present
        | illness, medical history, allergy history, personal history, clinical
        | features), users can generate an electronic OPD report that includes a
        | diagnosis and treatment recommendations. Dr. Molar AI (the &quot;
      span.c10 Web App
      span &quot;) 
      span.c15
        | platform for automated dental diagnosis and electronic OPD report generation 
      span operated by 
      span.c11 Dental Clinician
      span &nbsp;(&quot;
      span.c10 Dr. Molar AI
      span
        | &quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot; and/or &quot;our&quot;). In
        | addition to making available the Web App, the Dental Clinician website
        | (the &quot;
      span.c10 Site
      span &quot;) is operated by 
      span.c11 Dental Clinician
      span &nbsp;
      span
        | and has been created to provide information about our company and the
        | services we offer, including the web application and any other related
        | services (collectively, the &quot;
      span.c10 Services
      span
        | &quot;) to our Service visitors and users (&quot;you&quot;,
        | &quot;your&quot;). This Privacy Policy sets forth Dr. Molar AI&apos;s
        | policy with respect to information including personally identifiable
        | data (&quot;
      span.c10 Personal Data
      span.c1
        | &quot;) and other information that is collected on or in connection
        | with the Services, including our website chatbot service.
    p.c0
      span.c1
    p.c2
      span.c1
        | Dental Clinician is committed to maintaining the confidentiality,
        | integrity and security of the Personal Data provided by our users. We
        | are not in the business of selling your Personal Data to third
        | parties.
    p.c0
      span.c1
    p.c0
      span.c1
