    p.c2
      span.c10 Personal Data That You Provide Through the Services: 
      span.c1
        | We collect Personal Data from you when you voluntarily provide
        | such information, such as when you contact us with inquiries, register
        | for access to the Web App, select or enter Personal Data on the Web App
        | (including health information), respond to one of our prompts, or use
        | certain Services.
    p.c0
      span.c1
    p.c2
      span.c5
        | By voluntarily providing us with Personal Data, you are consenting to
        | our use of it in accordance with this Privacy Policy. If you provide
        | Personal Data to the Services, you acknowledge and agree that such
        | Personal Data may be transferred from your current location to the
        | offices and servers of Dental Clinician and the authorized third parties
        | referred to herein located in the United States.
    p.c0
