      span.c3 Exclusions: 
    p.c2
      span.c1
        | This Privacy Policy does not apply to any Personal Data collected by
        | Dr. Molar AI other than Personal Data collected through the Services.
        | This Privacy Policy shall not apply to any unsolicited information you
        | provide to Dr. Molar AI through the Services or through any other means.
